 d + c * d - a * b * c - a * b * d - a * c * d - b * c * d \u2264 5 / 16  := by\n  /-\n  Given positive real numbers \\(a, b, c, d\\) such that \\(a + b + c + d = 1\\), we need to prove that:\n  \\[ ab + ac + ad + bc + bd + cd - abc - abd - acd - bcd \\leq \\frac{5}{16} \\]\n  To prove this, we use the non-linear arithmetic (nlinarith) tactic, which simplifies the expression by considering the non-negativity of squares and other algebraic properties.\n  -/\n  -- Use non-linear arithmetic to simplify the expression by considering the non-negativity of squares and other algebraic properties.\n  nlinarith [sq_nonneg (a - 1 / 4), sq_nonneg (b - 1 / 4), sq_nonneg (c - 1 / 4), sq_nonneg (d - 1 / 4),\n    sq_nonneg (a - b), sq_nonneg (a - c), sq_nonneg (a - d), sq_nonneg (b - c), sq_nonneg (b - d),\n    sq_nonneg (c - d)]\n","values":[-1.0,-1.0,1.0,0.3125,-0.0625,-0.0625,-0.0625,-0.0625,0.5,-0.5,-0.078125,0.078125,0.041666666666666664,-0.041666666666666664,0.041666666666666664,-0.041666666666666664,0.041666666666666664,-0.041666666666666664,0.041666666666666664,-0.041666666666666664,-0.016276041666666668,0.013020833333333334,0.013020833333333334,0.013020833333333334,0.013020833333333334,-0.00390625,-0.00390625,-0.00390625,-0.00390625,-0.00390625,-0.00390625,-0.00390625,-0.00390625,-0.00390625,-0.00390625,-1.0,1.0,-1.0,0.5,1.0,-1.0,0.3125,-0.0625,-0.0625,-0.0625,-0.0625,-1.0,1.0,0.078125,-0.078125,-0.375,0.375,-0.041666666666666664,0.041666666666666664,-0.041666666666666664,0.041666666666666664,-0.041666666666666664,0.041666666666666664,-0.10416666666666667,0.0625,0.03125,0.03125,0.03125,-1.0,1.0,-1.0,0.5,1.0,-1.0,0.3125,-0.0625,-0.0625,-0.0625,-0.0625,-1.0,1.0,0.078125,-0.078125,-0.041666666666666664,0.041666666666666664,-0.375,0.375,-0.041666666666666664,0.041666666666666664,-0.041666666666666664,0.041666666666666664,-0.10416666666666667,0.03125,0.0625,0.03125,0.03125,-1.0,1.0,-1.0,0.5,1.0,-1.0,0.3125,-0.0625,-0.0625,-0.0625,-0.0625,-1.0,1.0,0.078125,-0.078125,-0.04166666